*.pyc
# owner uploads are runtime data, not source: `images/shops/<category>/` IS the catalogue and is
# committed. **the leading slash is load-bearing** - `universal/` once sat here without one, which
# matches a directory of that name at any depth, so `images/shops/universal/` was ignored too and
# the whole curated catalogue existed in one copy on one laptop.
/images/shops/uploads/
secrets.vault.enc
budget.md
